# HELP net_dhcp_dhcp_routes_applied_total DHCP option-121 classless static routes handed to Docker. Counts routes, not Joins.
# TYPE net_dhcp_dhcp_routes_applied_total counter
net_dhcp_dhcp_routes_applied_total 1196133

# HELP net_dhcp_dhcp_default_route_superseded_total Joins whose option-121 routes cover 0.0.0.0/0 by union rather than by a literal default entry, so container egress follows those next hops even though the reported gateway still names the option-3 router. Legitimate in split-tunnel setups; the point is that it is now visible.
# TYPE net_dhcp_dhcp_default_route_superseded_total counter
net_dhcp_dhcp_default_route_superseded_total 6302980

# HELP net_dhcp_lease_time_clamped_total Option-51 lease lifetimes cut down before use as the outage watchdog's deadline. The reported lease time is unchanged. Non-zero means a server granted a container a lease long enough to switch silent-lapse detection off.
# TYPE net_dhcp_lease_time_clamped_total counter
net_dhcp_lease_time_clamped_total 7936126

# HELP net_dhcp_mtu_refused_total Option-26 MTUs outside the range the plugin will apply; the container link keeps the MTU it had.
# TYPE net_dhcp_mtu_refused_total counter
net_dhcp_mtu_refused_total 3489289

# HELP net_dhcp_dhcp_server_tier_fallbacks_total Steps down the dhcp_servers ladder: one per preferred entry that did not answer inside its slice of the budget and handed on to the next. One acquisition against three silent preferred servers adds 2, not 1. The only outside signal that a preferred server is silently dead.
# TYPE net_dhcp_dhcp_server_tier_fallbacks_total counter
net_dhcp_dhcp_server_tier_fallbacks_total 8445708

# HELP net_dhcp_dhcp_server_policy_exhausted_total Acquisitions abandoned because no server listed in dhcp_servers answered.
# TYPE net_dhcp_dhcp_server_policy_exhausted_total counter
net_dhcp_dhcp_server_policy_exhausted_total 5477278

# HELP net_dhcp_dhcp_server_policy_timeouts_total dhcp_timeouts on endpoints whose renewal client is restricted to dhcp_servers.
# TYPE net_dhcp_dhcp_server_policy_timeouts_total counter
net_dhcp_dhcp_server_policy_timeouts_total 2924899

# HELP net_dhcp_recovered_ok_total Endpoints whose renewal client was rebuilt after a plugin restart.
# TYPE net_dhcp_recovered_ok_total counter
net_dhcp_recovered_ok_total 8136428

# HELP net_dhcp_recovery_failed_total Post-restart rebuilds that failed for a container that is still running; it runs without lease renewal and loses its IP at expiry. Healthy-affecting.
# TYPE net_dhcp_recovery_failed_total counter
net_dhcp_recovery_failed_total 1874759

# HELP net_dhcp_recovery_deferred_total Recovery walks postponed because the daemon was still starting (#383). Not a fault.
# TYPE net_dhcp_recovery_deferred_total counter
net_dhcp_recovery_deferred_total 3923189

# HELP net_dhcp_recovery_aborted_container_gone_total Endpoints skipped during recovery because their container had already exited. Not a fault.
